{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4ea41e58-3b68-5ce7-b58b-ace2f5319f37", "source_ordinal": 2345, "reading_ordinal": 1710, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不立文字", "published_at": "2023-03-19T06:06:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/589693312/answer/2942867355"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "标准化考试考的东西，只是让你有被培养的资格。如果只是会标准化考试的东西，基本上在职业上还是一个半无能状态。即使它可以应付哈佛、牛津的入学考，对于应付实际的事务，水平仍然相去甚远。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "实际事务是一种恐怖而神秘的怪兽。每次当事人活着回来讲的故事，根本不是ta幸存的真正原因。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "按照ta讲的故事去寻宝的人，十有八九都有去无回。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "连当事人自己其实都不太明白，AI要学其实也无从学起。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人类真正的优势其实是出人意料而客观上却恰好合用的愚蠢。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人的智慧，AI可学。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但是人的愚蠢，却是连人自身都无法认知的。", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这份幸运的愚蠢，", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "教外别传，不立文字，", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "直指人心，见性而成。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "既无可教，也无可学。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "对于人才培养，其实影响不大。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 304}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "要学画，有了AI，自己还是要会点线面、透视、结构、明暗、冷暖、配色、构图等知识。要学明白，还是一步都不能省。", "char_start": 305, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "要学音乐，有了ai，还是要乐器乐理演奏作曲指挥。要学明白，还是一步都不能少。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "要学写作，有了AI，还是要学炼字、造句、谋篇、作文。要学明白，还是一步都不能少。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "整明白了，你会比那些花了同样的精力玩AI的人玩得更好，而且好得多。", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "ta们不从这些基本功入手，用AI弄些自己看不出毛病的样子货四处卖弄，到最后还是一样一场空。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "AI的存在不能代替你自己的修炼。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "如果说有影响，只是给了一些本来就厌学的人更堂皇的理由把自己的厌学“合法化”。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "从而将ta们变得更加无能。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 589}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "也就是说，它对你的“帮助”，其实主要是会帮你绞杀一批心怀侥幸的对手。", "char_start": 590, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这很公平——学艺不诚，终无所获。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 641}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "决定最后出品水平的是作品的作者，而不是作者的助手。", "char_start": 642, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "不要理会这些噪音，安心的继续练你的基本功。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 689}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "踏实是核心竞争力。", "char_start": 690, "char_end": 699}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0260"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：GPT-4 升级成「考霸」，可高分通过各种标准化考试，这会对教育考试和人才培养带来哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“不立文字”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“标准化考试考的东西，只是让你有被培养的资格。如果只是会标准化考试的东西，基本上在职业上还是一个半无能状态。即使它可以应付哈佛、牛津的入学考，对于应付实际的事务，水平仍然相去甚远。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "标准化考试考的东西，只是让你有被培养的资格。如果只是会标准化考试的东西，基本上在职业上还是一个半无能状态。即使它可以应付哈佛、牛津的入学考，对于应付实际的事务，水平仍然相去甚远。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 89, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "13bd51cf-60f2-54ed-bdee-2e1a9cdf32dc", "source_ordinal": 2344, "reading_ordinal": 1711, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "有罪推定", "published_at": "2023-03-19T13:12:16+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/541669298/answer/2943290994"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一般侦查、检察机关的作为所基于的是合理怀疑/侦查假说，不叫“有罪推定”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "认为存在可疑、存在有罪的可能，然后根据这个判断去投入资源，搞清这个可能性是否可被证实或者可被证伪，这不叫“有罪推定”。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "只有“无需投入资源进行证实或证伪，仅仅因为存在嫌疑就认为犯罪事实必然成立”，这才叫“有罪推定”。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "简单来说，“有罪推定”是一个只有在判定环节才可能发生的问题，因此避免有罪推定是仅仅对法官、陪审团这种审判者才适用的责任，对一切侦查机关、检控机关，根本就不适用。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "侦查、检察机关既然没有裁定罪责的职权，ta们也就根本没有“有罪推定”的能力。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "能力都没有，怎么可能有这种罪名？", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "第二，法院很少否决纪委、监委的调查结果，是因为纪委、监委这些人办的案子如果都越过了党纪处罚的标准线，到了移交检察院起诉的地步，意味着这些案情的可靠程度已经客观上受到了严格的检验。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这就跟“亲爹告儿子忤逆，送儿子去坐牢，极少有冤案”的原理一样。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这些干部都是党内的精英成员，是至关重要的重大资产，有使其改过自新的余地，就跟老爹教训儿子一样，无论怎么重罚，都是尽可能不愿伤其性命的。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "然而移交检察院处理，往往跟着一句人们以为“没啥意义”的话——“撤销一切党内职务，开除党籍”。这其实就是因为已经无可挽回，结束了这人的政治生命。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "简单来说，就是这是已经“大义灭亲”后移送的案子。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "严重到了这一步，最后却被法庭认定没有任何问题的可能性，在客观逻辑上，天然就是很小的。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 614}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这也是为什么在古代，忤逆案几乎不怎么审，只要亲爹敢送，衙门就敢直接打。单纯从利害关系的角度看，衙门的父母官的标准没可能比你的亲生父母高——如果父母都认定有罪，那么衙门干脆“免检办理”了。", "char_start": 615, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "现在至少还是老实的单独重新审查了一遍。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以现在这个问题，等于是在问“为何客人检验厨师吃过的菜结果总是无毒”“病人想请医生拔掉的牙为什么总是真的有毛病”。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 786}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "值得补充的是——客观上的确ccp党内调查的周密、深入、迅捷程度要远超于一般行政和治安调查。党内纪律处分的发起门槛也要远比一般侦查、检察机关低。纪律处分的审批也要远比一般司法敏捷、严厉。", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你可以自己比较一下党纪工作和一般司法案件的调查审理流程和机制。", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 912}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "中共中央印发中国共产党纪律检查委员会工作条例_中央有关文件_中国政府网", "char_start": 913, "char_end": 948}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "很轻易可以发现，前者的森严程度是远超一般司法体制的。", "char_start": 948, "char_end": 974}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你要拿什么共和党、民主党、民进党的所谓党纪去对比共产党的党纪，你会发现前者基本上是一种过家家式的玩笑。", "char_start": 975, "char_end": 1026}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "基本上在这些西方政党而言，只要你不影响本党的选票，或者有办法不用纪律处分而避免你对选情造成影响，自然就没有纪律处分可言。", "char_start": 1027, "char_end": 1087}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "实在不行，你本人也可以自请辞职了事。", "char_start": 1088, "char_end": 1106}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而且绝大多数处分都仅止于“取消党内提名”“撤销党内职务”这类选举相关的处置。", "char_start": 1107, "char_end": 1145}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "看看这个介绍，别看它用了很多赞美之词，实际上你真去翻一下西方政党的条文，会发现基本上全都围绕选举，最坏结果也就是不给选了。", "char_start": 1146, "char_end": 1207}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "甚至所谓的“党内监管”，客观上主要靠的是外部媒体爆料。", "char_start": 1208, "char_end": 1235}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "国外严明党纪：党员不可“任性”_共产党员网", "char_start": 1236, "char_end": 1257}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "而最大的违纪行为是啥？", "char_start": 1257, "char_end": 1268}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "不是贪污受贿、不是强奸幼女、不是赌博吸毒、不是杀人抢劫——这些只要你有办法不上新闻，党内其实没人真的关心。", "char_start": 1269, "char_end": 1322}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "最大的罪行，是“作为党员，不投票给本党提名人和提案”。", "char_start": 1323, "char_end": 1350}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "立刻开除、永不录用。", "char_start": 1351, "char_end": 1361}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 33}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 2}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 913, "sample": "中共中央印发中国共产党纪律检查委员会工作条例_中央有关文件_中国政府网"}, {"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 1236, "sample": "国外严明党纪：党员不可“任性”_共产党员网"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0260"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：监委办案是否都是“有罪推定”？法院判决是否只能全盘认可监委的调查结果？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“有罪推定”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一般侦查、检察机关的作为所基于的是合理怀疑/侦查假说，不叫“有罪推定”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一般侦查、检察机关的作为所基于的是合理怀疑/侦查假说，不叫“有罪推定”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "880aecbd-fc09-5096-bc20-778f446ca95d", "source_ordinal": 2343, "reading_ordinal": 1712, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "集体主义精神", "published_at": "2023-03-19T14:18:43+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/35742423/answer/2943375083"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "在中文大众语境里的“集体主义精神”，其实在英文里根本不对应collectivism，而是team spirit。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "也就是团队精神。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很多小孩子意见极大的“集体主义牺牲精神”，在英语里叫“take one for the team”。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "看着西方意识形态把collectivism描述成洪水猛兽，仿佛万恶之源。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但是等你找工作的时候，去看看ta们的面试要求，有没有“富有团队精神”这一条？", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "等你工作的时候，去看看ta们的培训手册，有没有“It’s all about teamwork”这一句？", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "等时候到了，要求你“take one for the team”的时候，你拒绝试试？", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "说白了，你会产生这种疑问，其实是西方学术腐败的结果。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "仅此而已。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 321}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0260"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么要培养集体主义精神？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“集体主义精神”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“在中文大众语境里的“集体主义精神”，其实在英文里根本不对应collectivism，而是team spirit。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "在中文大众语境里的“集体主义精神”，其实在英文里根本不对应collectivism，而是team spirit。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e9255064-2bae-55f5-9528-6fc3b1f023f8", "source_ordinal": 2342, "reading_ordinal": 1713, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "母乳喂养", "published_at": "2023-03-19T17:17:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/542022046/answer/2943594941"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是多余的担心。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "女性产后必然生理性泌乳，不排出是会出问题的，甚至不及时处理会有很大的生理痛苦，始终不通畅还要挂急诊就医。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你们的争论本质上仅仅只是让婴儿直接吮吸，还是用挤奶器，以及“对肯定要产出的母乳，是保存起来喂给婴儿食用还是拿去扔掉”。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个嘛，", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "子曰，来都来了。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "等真的到了时候，人的想法可能就是另一回事了。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 158}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0260"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女朋友坚决拒绝母乳，我希望就一次行母乳喂养被指责我不顾她的痛苦，我真的很过分吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“母乳喂养”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是多余的担心。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是多余的担心。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "519ff79d-3ef9-5feb-88fe-94b8d61c1259", "source_ordinal": 2341, "reading_ordinal": 1714, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "误导式加密", "published_at": "2023-03-20T03:57:19+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/576682585/answer/2944181447"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一个圆柱，从头顶看是圆形，从侧面看是方形。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "只有正确的密钥会让你从头顶看，其它所有的密钥都会让你从侧面看。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "基本上就是这么回事。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 64}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 3}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0260"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有没有一种密码方式，如果破译者持有错误的密钥，那么会解译出错误但是意义通顺的明文？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003"], "summary": "围绕“误导式加密”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一个圆柱，从头顶看是圆形，从侧面看是方形。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一个圆柱，从头顶看是圆形，从侧面看是方形。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "10502a49-c8d6-5367-a8b0-bbf6c8bb713e", "source_ordinal": 2340, "reading_ordinal": 1715, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "独立思考的要害", "published_at": "2023-03-20T21:47:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/545374557/answer/2945495205"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "独立思考的要害只有一个，就是独立检验事实。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "只要事实是你独立检验的，", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那么在自己得出结论的过程中——", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "可以与人讨论，", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "可以参考别人的意见，", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "可以依赖专家见解，", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "甚至可以经过考虑后干脆完全同意别人的意见，", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这些并不威胁你思考的独立性。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "对独立思考的唯一威胁——注意，是唯一的威胁——就是你把事实检验这一步也委托给了别人。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "只要事实检验是独立的，那么你的思考就是独立的。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "只要事实来自未经自己检验的道听途说，那么你的思考就是不独立的。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "为什么呢？", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 222}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我们以1+1=2为例。", "char_start": 223, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这个推演一共三个要素：", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "1）那两个1，也就是思考的材料。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "2）那个加号，也就是思考的逻辑工具。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "3）你自己运用思考的工具，加工思考的材料，得到思考的结果的这个行为。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这三个要素里面，第三条这个行为，必然是你自己完成的。世界上还没有发明从外部直接介入脑部思维的技术和方法，根本就没有“不独立“可言。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "剩下的两个要素——基本材料和方法——分别指向了两个你必须自己独立核查的事实：材料的真实性和方法的可靠性。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "材料的真实性好理解——那两个1是不是真的是1，没准其实是1+2，张三干脆就是骗你的，或着连他自己也不清楚，就是顺嘴胡扯。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你不自己核实这两个1，你的思考结果其实一开始就被张三决定了。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你要独立的检查加法到底是个什么方法，什么叫做a+b，是不是每一次一个a加上一个b都等于c，c是多少。要做实验、要反复检验。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 591}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你要独立检验方法的可靠性，这是你的责任。", "char_start": 592, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你要是自己不做实验，直接相信张三跟你说的什么“加法就是随便后面加一位”，那么你在“加法是什么”这里已经抛弃了自己的独立性了。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这两者实际上都是“独立核查事实”，所以我们说独立思考唯一的要求，就是独立核查事实。", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 717}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "不错，按照这个定义，你绝大多数的思考都确实是建立在道听途说（例如来自新闻或者他人转述）基础上，因而不能算完全的独立思考。", "char_start": 719, "char_end": 779}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "只有很少部分的事情，你可以有真正的独立检验的机会，能有机会真正的做到独立思考。", "char_start": 780, "char_end": 819}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "那么这里就是关键了——你要学会用自己有独立检验、独立思考所得来的结论来印证、检察那些无法直接检验的信息，以救赎那些缺乏良好条件的思考的独立性。", "char_start": 820, "char_end": 891}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "救不了全部，但是好歹能救一些。", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 907}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "救一点，就好一点。", "char_start": 908, "char_end": 917}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "哪些东西你是可以真的独立检验的？", "char_start": 918, "char_end": 934}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "例如科学实验你可以自己做，几何学结论你可以自己验证，另外还有一些人你有亲自接触，一些事你有亲身经历。", "char_start": 935, "char_end": 985}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "这些东西，就是你的立身之本，思考之锚，其他的一切都是借助逻辑链条铆钉在这个根基上的。", "char_start": 986, "char_end": 1028}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "链接得越牢，独立性越强。", "char_start": 1029, "char_end": 1041}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "注意——充分独立，不意味着你一定会“反主流”、或者一定会独特。", "char_start": 1042, "char_end": 1073}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "只能靠独特性和反主流性来获得“独立感”，这是一种可悲的代偿行为，实际上毫无意义。", "char_start": 1074, "char_end": 1114}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "不要拿“反主流性”当作独立思考的证据；", "char_start": 1116, "char_end": 1135}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "也不要拿“不与人交流”当作独立思考的手段，", "char_start": 1136, "char_end": 1157}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "更不要把“认同别人的看法”当作独立思考的失败。", "char_start": 1158, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "记住，唯一的要求，就是独立核查事实。", "char_start": 1183, "char_end": 1201}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "举个例子：", "char_start": 1203, "char_end": 1208}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "丹东一93岁老人向社区申请看病被拒，老人在社区门口上吊身亡，你怎么看？", "char_start": 1209, "char_end": 1244}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 48}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 1209, "sample": "丹东一93岁老人向社区申请看病被拒，老人在社区门口上吊身亡，你怎么看？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0260"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：真正的独立思考是什么样子？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042"], "summary": "围绕“独立思考的要害”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“独立思考的要害只有一个，就是独立检验事实。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "独立思考的要害只有一个，就是独立检验事实。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2eca1ab5-e5fd-5ec9-a5e9-61e9e7375dc0", "source_ordinal": 2339, "reading_ordinal": 1716, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "强强", "published_at": "2023-03-21T00:50:38+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/518965993/answer/2945709615"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "幸好，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "世界上没有比我强的人。", "char_start": 4, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "得意的转圈圈。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "其实我不比你强，", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不过可惜，", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你不信。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 45}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0260"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我交朋友总是需要向下兼容，因为我非常难以信任比我强的人，但是我又想要交到优秀的朋友，我该怎么办呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“强强”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“幸好，”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "幸好，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a03985bb-d05e-5b31-86e8-90f9baee69ef", "source_ordinal": 2338, "reading_ordinal": 1717, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "利益共同体", "published_at": "2023-03-21T02:16:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/590364412/answer/2945747516"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "利益共同体，并不意味着“你的就是我的”，而是“我获益就会对你有好处，我受损就会对你有坏处”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这就像“军阀和政客勾结在一起，结成了利益共同体”，那只意味着北伐军打军阀也会损害政客的利益，所以ta们要相互合作。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你让政客没收一下军阀的部队试试看，你看利益共同体能支撑这种操作吗？", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "子女就算跟你再怎么闹，如果你在别人面前破衣烂衫，ta们一样名誉受损，你发财了ta们也有遗产继承/减轻赡养负担。是这个一损俱损的关联性决定是不是利益共同体，而不是相互间的支配权或者感情关系。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以，子女要和你划分界限、主张自己的财产权和他们自己的选择自由，跟ta们和你是不是利益共同体根本是两个独立的问题。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如果你要把利益共同体定义为“你的就是我的”，那么很遗憾的告诉你——别说子女，就算是夫妇也不算这种利益共同体。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "任意两个独立人格之间，都结成不了这种相互关系。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "只有一种情况，可以算单向的建立了这种关系，那就是奴隶主对奴隶。问题是，奴隶可就不能对奴隶主说“你的就是我的”了。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以这问题从题面上就错了——“两个家庭”跟“利益共同体”根本就不是互相排除的矛盾关系，而是从一开始就是并立的。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "从一开始，“利益共同体“就只是为一种贪婪办的假身份证罢了。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 513}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0260"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：人到老了，才发现自己跟子女不是利益共同体，而是两个家庭，你怎么看？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“利益共同体”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“利益共同体，并不意味着“你的就是我的”，而是“我获益就会对你有好处，我受损就会对你有坏处”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "利益共同体，并不意味着“你的就是我的”，而是“我获益就会对你有好处，我受损就会对你有坏处”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
